[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22320.948, "timestamp": "06:12:00", "text": "呃，躲起来。隐藏。印度一。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22326.23, "timestamp": "06:12:06", "text": "所以，嗯，我的意思是，就像我刚才说的，我确实……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22330.19, "timestamp": "06:12:10", "text": "我是否允许我去我的区域？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22333.91, "timestamp": "06:12:13", "text": "我是说，我创建了所有这些Discord。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22337.788, "timestamp": "06:12:17", "text": "我的意思是，在此之前我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22342.23, "timestamp": "06:12:22", "text": "我没错，我还有两处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22345.67, "timestamp": "06:12:25", "text": "昆虫，我的意思是，它实际上是疼痛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22348.788, "timestamp": "06:12:28", "text": "决定头像并驾驶它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22351.67, "timestamp": "06:12:31", "text": "那是痛苦，我的意思是，我可以接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22353.15, "timestamp": "06:12:33", "text": "简单的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22358.788, "timestamp": "06:12:38", "text": "方式。就像虚空一样简单，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22361.59, "timestamp": "06:12:41", "text": "但我不想去虚空。我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22364.27, "timestamp": "06:12:44", "text": "我想做成这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22367.788, "timestamp": "06:12:47", "text": "你知道的。我想做成这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22370.35, "timestamp": "06:12:50", "text": "这种超"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22372.03, "timestamp": "06:12:52", "text": "实际的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22374.75, "timestamp": "06:12:54", "text": "夏威夷就像这种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22377.27, "timestamp": "06:12:57", "text": "模型。我不知道。我不知道。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22379.59, "timestamp": "06:12:59", "text": "准备好在 Blender 3D 中挣扎求生，甚至牺牲自己"}]